Package: rbta
Type: Package
Title: Functions to support the reproducibility of biodiversity trend analyses
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Martin Wilkes <m.wilkes@essex.ac.uk>
Maintainer: Martin Wilkes <m.wilkes@essex.ac.uk>
Description: Filters biodiversity records, aggregates records to a target taxonomic rank, and assesses environmental collection bias associated with biodiversity monitoring.
